Package: fishextract
Title: Common data extraction and visualisation functions for OFP data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Freddie", "Heather", , "freddieh@spc.int", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: `fishextract` aims to simplify, document, and automate some
    of the most common functions used in the process of data extraction
    and visualisation in OFP data.
